    "html": "<header class=\"arch-heading\"><p>产线 03 / 录屏怎么做 ①</p><h1>把玩法录完整</h1><div class=\"arch-subtitle\">不是 AI 盯着屏幕打游戏，而是游戏自己报状态，程序照着按键</div></header>\n <div class=\"arch-board arch-record holly-loop\">\n <svg class=\"arch-wires\" viewBox=\"0 0 1708 665\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><marker id=\"arch-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 1 1 L 9 5 L 1 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8290a3\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></marker></defs>\n  <g class=\"arch-wire \" data-arch-step=\"1\"><path class=\"arch-wire-base\" d=\"M 370 220 H 446\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><path class=\"arch-wire-run\" d=\"M 370 220 H 446\" pathLength=\"1\"/></g><g class=\"arch-wire \" data-arch-step=\"2\"><path class=\"arch-wire-base\" d=\"M 816 220 H 892\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><path class=\"arch-wire-run\" d=\"M 816 220 H 892\" pathLength=\"1\"/></g><g class=\"arch-wire \" data-arch-step=\"3\"><path class=\"arch-wire-base\" d=\"M 1262 220 H 1338\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><path class=\"arch-wire-run\" d=\"M 1262 220 H 1338\" pathLength=\"1\"/></g>\n  <g class=\"arch-wire feedback\" data-arch-step=\"4\"><path class=\"arch-wire-base\" d=\"M 1523 380 V 428 H 185 V 383\" marker-end=\"url(#arch-arrow)\"/><path class=\"arch-wire-run\" d=\"M 1523 380 V 428 H 185 V 383\" pathLength=\"1\"/></g></svg>\n <section class=\"arch-node source\" data-arch-step=\"0\" style=\"left:0px;top:60px;width:370px;min-height:320px\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">① 仪表盘</p><h2>看懂</h2><p class=\"arch-detail\">游戏用文字报告：位置、大小、周围有什么、第几关</p></section>\n <section class=\"arch-node reason\" data-arch-step=\"1\" style=\"left:446px;top:60px;width:370px;min-height:320px\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">②</p><h2>决定</h2><p class=\"arch-detail\">比我小就吃、比我大就绕开；或打开自动演示</p></section>\n <section class=\"arch-node core\" data-arch-step=\"2\" style=\"left:892px;top:60px;width:370px;min-height:320px\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">③ 方向盘</p><h2>操作</h2><p class=\"arch-detail\">Playwright 按键，<br>和人按的一样</p></section>\n <section class=\"arch-node execute\" data-arch-step=\"3\" style=\"left:1338px;top:60px;width:370px;min-height:320px\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">④</p><h2>拍照 + 记录</h2><p class=\"arch-detail\">每走一步存一帧，<br>同时记下状态</p></section>\n <p class=\"arch-line-label\" data-arch-step=\"4\" style=\"left:780px;top:408px\">直到通关</p>\n <div class=\"loop-output\" data-arch-step=\"4\"><span>产出</span><h2>完整玩法画面 + 状态记录</h2><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i><p>确认玩到通关；按记录定位精彩片段<br><small>第 53 口、14,000 km 都是真实数字</small></p></div>\n <p class=\"loop-foot\">Claude 负责定规则、找片段；每一帧的操作交给小程序 · 换新游戏需适配</p>\n </div>",
