    "html": "<header class=\"arch-heading\"><p>产线 03 / 录屏怎么做 ②</p><h1>把玩法录得顺</h1><div class=\"arch-subtitle\">上一页解决“录什么”，这一页解决“录出来卡不卡”</div></header>\n <div class=\"smooth-compare\">\n  <section class=\"smooth-panel bad\" data-arch-step=\"0\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">游戏一边跑，录屏一边拍</p><h2>普通录屏（实时）</h2>\n   <div class=\"frame-strip\"><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:0\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:1\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:2\"></i><i class=\"dup\" style=\"--x:2\"><em>卡</em></i><i class=\"dup\" style=\"--x:2\"><em>卡</em></i><i class=\"jump\" style=\"--x:5\"><em>跳</em></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:6\"></i><i class=\"dup\" style=\"--x:6\"><em>卡</em></i><i class=\"jump\" style=\"--x:9\"><em>跳</em></i></div>\n   <p class=\"smooth-result\">电脑一忙就掉帧，卡顿被录进视频</p></section>\n  <span class=\"smooth-vs\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n  <section class=\"smooth-panel good\" data-arch-step=\"1\"><p class=\"arch-kicker\">像拍定格动画</p><h2>逐帧录</h2>\n   <p class=\"smooth-chain\"><span>接管游戏时钟</span>→<span>走 1/30 秒</span>→<span>停住拍一张</span>→<span>再走</span></p>\n   <div class=\"frame-strip\"><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:0\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:1\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:2\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:3\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:4\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:5\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:6\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:7\"></i><i class=\"\" style=\"--x:8\"></i></div>\n   <p class=\"smooth-result\">电脑慢只是录得久，成片永远 30 帧</p></section>\n </div>\n <div class=\"smooth-check\" data-arch-step=\"2\"><b>录完自动检查</b><span>找出画面静止 / 卡顿的位置（通关后画面停住），剪辑自动避开</span><span>慢放的地方自动补帧</span></div>\n <p class=\"record-takeaway\">录得完整靠“看懂和操作”，录得顺靠“控制时间”</p>",
