    "html": "\n <div class=\"title-block\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">产线 03 / 在录屏基础上打磨脚本</p><h1 data-animate=\"title\">以创作者身份，介绍自己做的游戏</h1></div>\n <div class=\"p-storyboard story-five\">\n <figure data-step=\"0\"><img src=\"assets/holly-story-result.jpg\" alt=\"雪球成片开头的夸张结果画面\"><figcaption><span>0–3 秒</span><h2>先给结局</h2></figcaption></figure>\n <figure data-step=\"1\"><img src=\"assets/holly-story-start.jpg\" alt=\"雪球成片倒带画面\"><figcaption><span>约 3–4 秒</span><h2>倒带一下</h2></figcaption></figure>\n <figure data-step=\"2\"><img src=\"assets/holly-story-build.jpg\" alt=\"雪球成片中交代构建过程的信息卡：11m 50s\"><figcaption><span>4–17 秒</span><h2>交代怎么做出来的</h2></figcaption></figure>\n <figure data-step=\"3\"><img src=\"assets/holly-story-grow.jpg\" alt=\"雪球成片中玩法不断升级的画面\"><figcaption><span>17–27 秒</span><h2>一路变大</h2></figcaption></figure>\n <figure data-step=\"4\"><img src=\"assets/holly-story-end.jpg\" alt=\"雪球成片的结果与结尾\"><figcaption><span>27–33 秒</span><h2>接下来吃什么？</h2></figcaption></figure>\n </div><p class=\"bottom-takeaway\" data-step=\"5\">讲我做了什么、怎么玩、哪里有趣，让产品出现在玩法里</p>\n <p class=\"story-future\" data-step=\"6\"><span><b>今天</b>AI 操控游戏，做成宣发内容</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\">→</i><span><b>未来</b>AI 操控更多产品和界面（网页、App、产品演示）来做宣发</span></p>",
